{
  "_comment": "domain 与 ip 必须拆成两条规则：同一条规则里两者是 AND，混写会永不命中（而 run -test 照样通过）。",
  "routing": {
    "domainStrategy": "IPIfNonMatch",
    "rules": [
      {
        "type": "field",
        "outboundTag": "blocked",
        "domain": [
          "ext:self-geosite.dat:advert.com",
          "ext:self-geosite.dat:advert.cn"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "field",
        "outboundTag": "proxy",
        "domain": [
          "ext:self-geosite.dat:self-proxy"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "field",
        "outboundTag": "direct",
        "domain": [
          "ext:self-geosite.dat:site.cn",
          "ext:self-geosite.dat:self-direct"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "field",
        "outboundTag": "direct",
        "ip": [
          "ext:self-geoip.dat:self-direct",
          "geoip:private",
          "geoip:cn"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "field",
        "outboundTag": "proxy",
        "network": "tcp,udp"
      }
    ]
  },
  "_bootstrap": "首次部署必须先手动下载一次 self-*.dat 放到资源目录：geodata 是「配置校验通过后才下载」，不能做首次引导（文件不存在时校验直接失败）。例：curl -fsSLO https://xinvxueyuan.github.io/proxy-rules/xray/self-geosite.dat",
  "geodata": {
    "cron": "@daily",
    "assets": [
      {
        "url": "https://xinvxueyuan.github.io/proxy-rules/xray/self-geosite.dat",
        "file": "self-geosite.dat"
      },
      {
        "url": "https://xinvxueyuan.github.io/proxy-rules/xray/self-geoip.dat",
        "file": "self-geoip.dat"
      }
    ]
  }
}
